            "EXALTED",
            "OWN_SIGN",
            "MOOLTRIKONA"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "type": "effect",
          "text": "tiger-faced and elephant-gaited, broad of chest, long and strong of hand, square of body, sensuous, soft-haired of cheek, learned, lotus-handed and lotus-footed, valorous and versed in yoga, knowing the meaning of the shastras, firm in prowess, black and short of hair, independent in all he undertakes, unforgiving even to his own people, letting his friends enjoy his wealth, a ruler of the middle country, and always happy"
        },
        {
          "type": "life-span",
          "count": 80.0,
          "unit": "years"
        }
      ]
    },
